trong>  places to eat</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_14\" value=\"C\" id=\"practice_16_14_C\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 14: C\"><span><strong>C</strong>  public transport</span></label></div></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"q-item q-card q-card q-card ielts-listening-question-item\" id=\"lqi-15\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">15</strong><div class=\"q-row\"><div class=\"q-main\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"q-num\">15</span><span>What practical thing must staff do now?</span></div><div class=\"opts\"><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_15\" value=\"A\" id=\"practice_16_15_A\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 15: A\"><span><strong>A</strong>  give details of damaged furniture</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_15\" value=\"B\" id=\"practice_16_15_B\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 15: B\"><span><strong>B</strong>  throw away unnecessary papers</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_15\" value=\"C\" id=\"practice_16_15_C\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 15: C\"><span><strong>C</strong>  take home personal items</span></label></div></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"q-item q-card q-card q-card ielts-listening-question-item\" id=\"lqi-16\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">16</strong><div class=\"q-row\"><div class=\"q-main\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"q-num\">16</span><span>Staff will need to put folders containing confidential details</span></div><div class=\"opts\"><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_16\" value=\"A\" id=\"practice_16_16_A\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 16: A\"><span><strong>A</strong>  into packing boxes</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_16\" value=\"B\" id=\"practice_16_16_B\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 16: B\"><span><strong>B</strong>  into grey plastic bags</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_16\" value=\"C\" id=\"practice_16_16_C\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 16: C\"><span><strong>C</strong>  into new filing cabinets</span></label></div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qgroup ms-group ms-group ms-group ms-group ms-group ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">17</strong><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">18</strong>\n  <h2>Questions 17 and 18</h2>\n  <div class=\"instr\">Choose <b>TWO</b> letters, <b>A-E</b>.</div>\n  <div class=\"q-item\"><div class=\"q-row\"><div class=\"q-main\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"q-num\">17-18</span><span>Which TWO things do people often forget when lifting heavy things?</span></div><div class=\"opts\"><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"pair-choice\" value=\"A\" name=\"practice_16_17_18\" id=\"practice_16_17_18_A\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 17: A\"><span><strong>A</strong>  keep your head up</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"pair-choice\" value=\"B\" name=\"practice_16_17_18\" id=\"practice_16_17_18_B\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 17: B\"><span><strong>B</strong>  don't bend your back</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"pair-choice\" value=\"C\" name=\"practice_16_17_18\" id=\"practice_16_17_18_C\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 17: C\"><span><strong>C</strong>  don't lean to one side</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"pair-choice\" value=\"D\" name=\"practice_16_17_18\" id=\"practice_16_17_18_D\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 17: D\"><span><strong>D</strong>  use handles</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"pair-choice\" value=\"E\" name=\"practice_16_17_18\" id=\"practice_16_17_18_E\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 17: E\"><span><strong>E</strong>  stand with feet apart</span></label></div></div><div class=\"pair-flags\"><span class=\"pair-anchor\" id=\"lqi-17\"></span><span class=\"pair-anchor\" id=\"lqi-18\"></span></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qgroup ms-group ms-group ms-group ms-group ms-group ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">19</strong><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">20</strong>\n  <h2>Questions 19 and 20</h2>\n  <div class=\"instr\">Choose <b>TWO</b> letters, <b>A-E</b>.</div>\n  <div class=\"q-item\"><div class=\"q-row\"><div class=\"q-main\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"q-num\">19-20</span><span>Which TWO things should staff do when moving papers?</span></div><div class=\"opts\"><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"pair-choice\" value=\"A\" name=\"practice_16_19_20\" id=\"practice_16_19_20_A\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 19: A\"><span><strong>A</strong>  wear a face mask</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"pair-choice\" value=\"B\" name=\"practice_16_19_20\" id=\"practice_16_19_20_B\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 19: B\"><span><strong>B</strong>  open windows</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"pair-choice\" value=\"C\" name=\"practice_16_19_20\" id=\"practice_16_19_20_C\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 19: C\"><span><strong>C</strong>  wear gloves</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"pair-choice\" value=\"D\" name=\"practice_16_19_20\" id=\"practice_16_19_20_D\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 19: D\"><span><strong>D</strong>  take frequent breaks</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"pair-choice\" value=\"E\" name=\"practice_16_19_20\" id=\"practice_16_19_20_E\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 19: E\"><span><strong>E</strong>  drink plenty of water</span></l