      "questions": "<div class=\"qgroup\">\n  <h2>Questions 21-26</h2>\n  <div class=\"instr\">Choose the correct letter, <b>A, B or C</b>.</div>\n  <div class=\"centered-title\">Mona’s presentation</div>\n  <div class=\"q-item q-card q-card q-card ielts-listening-question-item\" id=\"lqi-21\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">21</strong><div class=\"q-row\"><div class=\"q-main\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"q-num\">21</span><span>Mona’s presentation topic is about</span></div><div class=\"opts\"><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_21\" value=\"A\" id=\"practice_16_21_A\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 21: A\"><span><strong>A</strong>  design development from the 1800s</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_21\" value=\"B\" id=\"practice_16_21_B\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 21: B\"><span><strong>B</strong>  design development and social advancement</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_21\" value=\"C\" id=\"practice_16_21_C\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 21: C\"><span><strong>C</strong>  design development and art movement</span></label></div></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"q-item q-card q-card q-card ielts-listening-question-item\" id=\"lqi-22\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">22</strong><div class=\"q-row\"><div class=\"q-main\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"q-num\">22</span><span>Mona doesn’t want to just talk about one topic because</span></div><div class=\"opts\"><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_22\" value=\"A\" id=\"practice_16_22_A\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 22: A\"><span><strong>A</strong>  she is afraid of her tutor's response.</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_22\" value=\"B\" id=\"practice_16_22_B\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 22: B\"><span><strong>B</strong>  she wants to give a complete talk.</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_22\" value=\"C\" id=\"practice_16_22_C\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 22: C\"><span><strong>C</strong>  she thinks it would be too simple.</span></label></div></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"q-item q-card q-card q-card ielts-listening-question-item\" id=\"lqi-23\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">23</strong><div class=\"q-row\"><div class=\"q-main\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"q-num\">23</span><span>What does Ted say about Mona’s topic?</span></div><div class=\"opts\"><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_23\" value=\"A\" id=\"practice_16_23_A\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 23: A\"><span><strong>A</strong>  Very detailed</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_23\" value=\"B\" id=\"practice_16_23_B\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 23: B\"><span><strong>B</strong>  Too old</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_23\" value=\"C\" id=\"practice_16_23_C\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 23: C\"><span><strong>C</strong>  Too broad</span></label></div></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"q-item q-card q-card q-card ielts-listening-question-item\" id=\"lqi-24\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">24</strong><div class=\"q-row\"><div class=\"q-main\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"q-num\">24</span><span>What is Mona’s viewpoint on computers?</span></div><div class=\"opts\"><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_24\" value=\"A\" id=\"practice_16_24_A\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 24: A\"><span><strong>A</strong>  They have improved work efficiency.</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_24\" value=\"B\" id=\"practice_16_24_B\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 24: B\"><span><strong>B</strong>  They have influenced traditional media.</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_24\" value=\"C\" id=\"practice_16_24_C\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 24: C\"><span><strong>C</strong>  They have changed people's sense of style.</span></label></div></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"q-item q-card q-card q-card ielts-listening-question-item\" id=\"lqi-25\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">25</strong><div class=\"q-row\"><div class=\"q-main\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"q-num\">25</span><span>Why does Ted think of ‘purism’?</span></div><div class=\"opts\"><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_25\" value=\"A\" id=\"practice_16_25_A\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 25: A\"><span><strong>A</strong>  It's important for architecture.</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_25\" value=\"B\" id=\"practice_16_25_B\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 25: B\"><span><strong>B</strong>  It saves a lot of effort.</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_25\" value=\"C\" id=\"practice_16_25_C\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 25: C\"><span><strong>C</strong>  He admires it in arts.</span></label></div></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"q-item q-card q-card q-card ielts-listening-question-item\" id=\"lqi-26\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">26</strong><div class=\"q-row\"><div class=\"q-main\"><div class=\"q-stem\"><span class=\"q-num\">26</span><span>What does Ted suggest Mona do?</span></div><div class=\"opts\"><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_26\" value=\"A\" id=\"practice_16_26_A\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 26: A\"><span><strong>A</strong>  meet one of his friends</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_26\" value=\"B\" id=\"practice_16_26_B\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 26: B\"><span><strong>B</strong>  read more books</span></label><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_26\" value=\"C\" id=\"practice_16_26_C\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 26: C\"><span><strong>C</strong>  visit a museum</span></label></div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qgroup\">\n  <h2>Questions 27-30</h2>\n  <div class=\"instr\">According to Ted, what is the right way to make a successful presentation?<br>Choose <b>FOUR</b> answers from the box and write the correct letter, <b>A-G</b>, next to questions 27-30.</div>\n  <div class=\"optbox\"><div class=\"obtitle\">Steps</div><div class=\"orow\"><strong>A</strong>  text handouts</div><div class=\"orow\"><strong>B</strong>  questions</div><div class=\"orow\"><strong>C</strong>  an outline</div><div class=\"orow\"><strong>D</strong>  an introduction</div><div class=\"orow\"><strong>E</strong>  statement</div><div class=\"orow\"><strong>F</strong>  explain</div><div class=\"orow\"><strong>G</strong>  research</div></div>\n  <div class=\"grid-wrap\"><table class=\"matchgrid\"><thead><tr><th class=\"first\">Step</th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>D</th><th>E</th><th>F</th><th>G</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr id=\"lqi-27\" class=\"q-card q-card q-card q-card q-card q-card q-card ielts-listening-question-item\"><strong class=\"ielts-listening-question-number\">27</strong><td class=\"sb\"><span class=\"num\">27</span>Step 1. Write …</td><td class=\"letter\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_27\" value=\"A\" id=\"practice_16_27_A\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 27: A\"><span class=\"tick\">✓</span></label></td><td class=\"letter\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_27\" value=\"B\" id=\"practice_16_27_B\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Question 27: B\"><span class=\"tick\">✓</span></label></td><td class=\"letter\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"practice_16_27\" value=\"C\" id=\"practice_16_27_C\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-